Here’s today’s Sapiver Press puzzle comic.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Isla plans to slip into the steady bookstore corner before the morning rush truly begins.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,000
She makes her first mark on the grid while waiting for the morning train to arrive.

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,000
The soothing rhythm of the tracks helps her focus on the trickier sections of the grid.

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,000
A warm cup of tea beside her makes the tricky Anti-Knight rule feel much more manageable.

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
The afternoon light pours over her desk as she successfully places another tricky set of digits.

7
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Surrounded by leafy plants and the sound of soft rain, she reluctantly closes her puzzle book.

